  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>&nbsp;It is given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ad1d98e6-33a8-4285-b74e-098fb9f797e7.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 343px;\" /></p><p>The formula for angle of deviation is&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#948;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></math></p><p>Substituting the values,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#948;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p>",
